    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Rat King.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What of them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I said as much, this city has no need of further bloodshed. If they can escape, let them escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "To miss your old master is noble. And you spent your loyalty to buy the rights of your fellows to live on. That was a charitable act. But you must not get greedy in your requests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Y- yeah. But after that, that was way out of step with Lungmen's rules...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You learn quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have heard that long before Siracusa became what it is today, there was a time when the mafia there had some unwritten rules kept for survival's sake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people obeyed them, the people accepted them, and in turbulent times, the mafia came to be the most trusted group in society.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, they sold out, they traded in violence, and we came to where we are today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen has its laws, and I have my own code.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even Penguin Logistics has a set of rules for how they do whatever they want at all times, although they're all wildly different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Rat King, if the boss back then... if Mr. Gambino didn't pull his sword on you the first time you met, would things still have turned out like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave him a chance. Both before and after that moment. It was far more than just that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "But from time to time, and especially in business, first impressions are very important. You understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Pant pant*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is... the exit! It's close!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who's there?! Come out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you ain't dead. That's a surprise. Turns out the Rat King ain't so thorough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...The wound you gave me still aches, Capone. I'm real glad you came to face me yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I can kill you with my own hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All of Lungmen's after us. I really don't wanna waste time on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "So let's get this over with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're gonna pay for betraying the Family...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Family. Family, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "That word sure brings me back. Hey, have either of you seen Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th- that smell...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...a Lone Wolf. What are you doing in Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_140_whitew_1",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, Texas is here. Need I say more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, can you really call yourselves a 'Family' after you bolted from Siracusa to get away from all the responsibilities of being a Family? Can you still call yourselves 'Sicilian?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would the one who plundered your proud and glorious history... Miss Sicilia herself, would she agree?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up! Don't ever speak of her in front of me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're nothin' but a traitor! Who are you to call us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_140_whitew_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's enough, ass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you're wounded? I smell blood. Wolf's blood. Mmm, is that what they call the smell of home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas is different now, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really really different. A couple old friends from Siracusa come knocking on her door and she lets them leave Lungmen alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's so inhospitable. Downright shameful. But it's okay, I'll finish the job for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe if I bring her the corpses of a couple paisans from Siracusa that'll get her nice and worked up. Ooh, yeah, that's a great idea...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think she can escape? From the shadow of her Family, I mean? From her past?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Capone, stand firm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Now we're gonna fight side by side? What happened to your honor and Family?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call it self-preservation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. You scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just say I don't want her to be the one who kills me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Good point. If I'm gonna die, I'd rather make it to an open casket.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_140_whitew_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahahaha! Are you trembling?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to fight me when you can barely stand up straight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, sure. Watching the life leave your eyes as you struggle to live sounds like a good time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to count to ten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
